diff --git a/docs/CHECKOUT-ARCHITECTURE.md b/docs/CHECKOUT-ARCHITECTURE.md
index 3cb5898..9836ec1 100644
--- a/docs/CHECKOUT-ARCHITECTURE.md
+++ b/docs/CHECKOUT-ARCHITECTURE.md
@@ -50,3 +50,10 @@ Content: tech only; shopper rules in `docs/CONTEXT.md` (Cart, Checkout, Orders,
 - Layout: `AccountLogin` for guests, `AccountUnavailable` on transient failure.
 - Orders `src/lib/account/get-orders.ts` (paginated); `orders/[number]` searches `me.orders(first:100)`.
 - Addresses CRUD + default; settings: profile, password, delete account (`account/actions.ts`).
+
+## Age restriction (MIN-AGE)
+- Core enforces; storefront only displays. Restricted products stay listed; `ageLabel` ("N+", public) renders as a badge on PLP cards, PDP, cart (drawer + page) and checkout summary lines.
+- Birthday: owner-only. `CurrentUserBirthday` is a `session()` op read in a server island (`src/ui/components/account/birthday-section.tsx`); `updateBirthday` in `account/actions.ts` sends it as an `accountUpdate` variable (strict `YYYY-MM-DD`, empty clears). Never in `cached()` ops (`data-layer.contract.test.ts`); kernel log helper redacts any `birthday` key.
+- Add to cart: `addVariantToCart` returns `AddToCartResult`; `AddToCartForm` shows guest sign-in prompt / account-settings link / underage / not-eligible copy naming the product (`src/lib/age-restriction.ts`).
+- Checkout: `runCheckoutComplete` maps `AGE_RESTRICTED_*` to localized copy naming the products (`src/checkout/lib/age-restriction-errors.ts`, `checkout.server.age*`); code travels to the payment step (`setAgeRestrictionCode`) which offers the sign-in / account-settings link.
+
